        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    portfolio_returns = [0.25, 0.09, 0.15]\n    benchmark_returns = [0.15, 0.05, 0.18]\n    benchmark_weights = [0.35, 0.35, 0.30]\n\n    # Calculate security selection value added using benchmark weights\n    security_selection = sum(\n        weight * (portfolio_return - benchmark_return)\n        for weight, portfolio_return, benchmark_return in zip(\n            benchmark_weights, portfolio_returns, benchmark_returns\n        )\n    )\n    answer = round(security_selection * 100, 1)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
